/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::supportsAnimationPhysics()
\brief Test this build's physical-animation support.

\note Animation physics requires Chipmunk. The Basic solver supports simple shared-body physics but is intentionally not a backend for animation rigs; expanding it to complex animation physics is not planned. Enable Chipmunk on the SpriteLayer before rig setup.


\return True when built with Chipmunk physics support. This does not test the Sprite's current layer, rig, or scale.

\see setupAnimationPhysics(), isAnimationPhysicsEnabled()
*/
